		{
			"outputs":[
				
			],
			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"### 👻 Phantom Workflow (Multi-Image to Video)  \n`Combine up to 4 reference images into a single video`\n\nThis workflow uses a custom multi-image model to generate videos by fusing visual elements from multiple sources. Ideal for combining things like:\n\n🧠 Head + 👗 Outfit + 🌆 Background + 🎨 Accessory\n\n🛠️ To use:  \nAdd up to **4 images** through the input nodes  \nEach image will influence the final video — try using:  \n- 1️⃣ Subject/character  \n- 2️⃣ Outfit or style  \n- 3️⃣ Background or scene  \n- 4️⃣ Optional Accessory\n\n📌 You can use fewer than 4 images — the model will adapt just bypass the image group.\n---"
			],
			"inputs":[
				
			],
			"flags":{
				
			},
			"type":"MarkdownNote",
			"title":"ref images",
			"mode":0,
			"bgcolor":"#653",
			"size":[
				434.9781494140625,
				514.1713256835938
			],
			"pos":[
				-147.29930114746094,
				-502.79388427734375
			],
			"id":289,
			"properties":{
				"widget_ue_connectable":{
					
				}
			},
			"order":2
		},
		{
			"outputs":[
				
			],
			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"### 👻 幻影工作流程（多图像转视频）\n将最多4张参考图像合并成一个视频\n\n这个工作流程使用定制的多图像模型，通过融合多个来源的视觉元素来生成视频。非常适合组合以下内容：\n\n🧠头部 + 👗服装 + 🌆背景 + 🎨配饰\n\n🛠️使用方法：\n通过输入节点添加最多**4张图片**。\n每张图片都会影响最终的视频——尝试使用：\n- 1️⃣ 主题/角色\n- 2️⃣ 服装或风格\n- 3️⃣背景或场景\n- 4️⃣可选配件\n\n📌 你可以使用少于4张图片——模型会自行调整，只需跳过图片组即可。\n---"
			],
			"inputs":[
				
			],
			"flags":{
				
			},
			"type":"MarkdownNote",
			"title":"ref images",
			"mode":0,
			"bgcolor":"#653",
			"size":[
				434.9781494140625,
				514.1713256835938
			],
			"pos":[
				-622.9382934570312,
				-489.69879150390625
